Iteration: 2000 / 2000 [100%]  (Sampling)
Elapsed Time: 1.68253 seconds (Warm-up)
               1.61524 seconds (Sampling)
               3.29778 seconds (Total)

Iteration: 2000 / 2000 [100%]  (Sampling)
Elapsed Time: 1.66415 seconds (Warm-up)
               1.79391 seconds (Sampling)
               3.45806 seconds (Total)

Iteration: 2000 / 2000 [100%]  (Sampling)
Elapsed Time: 1.70177 seconds (Warm-up)
               1.56138 seconds (Sampling)
               3.26315 seconds (Total)

 > print(fit,digits=2)
Inference for Stan model: occupancy.
4 chains, each with iter=2000; warmup=1000; thin=1;
post-warmup draws per chain=1000, total post-warmup draws=4000.

         mean se_mean   sd    2.5%     25%     50%     75%   97.5% n_eff Rhat
psi1    0.37    0.00 0.03    0.31    0.35    0.37    0.39    0.43  2425    1
p       0.56    0.00 0.02    0.52    0.54    0.56    0.57    0.59  2203    1
lp__ -800.33    0.03 1.02 -803.08 -800.72 -800.01 -799.62 -799.36  1138    1

