From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Sat Jan  4 16:34:50 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Sat, 04 Jan 2014 16:34:50 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] More model-specific speed decreases from 1.3 to 2.1
Message-ID: <z5-BBDLORmw.esgft1DLUz4J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <z5-BBDLORmw.a8Vl61-a4M8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
