I just checked with Michael and so far, there's no guarantee
that the initial values will be saved as the first iteration
if the num_warmup or num_samples is set.

We do plan to fix it so that the init is always the first
iteration, but it's not going to happen for the upcoming
2.1.1 release, which will fix a number of outstanding issues.
Maybe in 2.2.0.

- Bob

