Date: Tue, 21 Jan 2014 20:52:36 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] creating user defined (normal mean) function in C++
Message-ID: <YxiFyUirPU4.uT8ft8fcp6cJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <YxiFyUirPU4.ku23AQzJzjMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <YxiFyUirPU4.8Z7_sCNgeiEJ@stan-users.groups.google.com> <YxiFyUirPU4.ku23AQzJzjMJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
